sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Visitor
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>ProjectDetailPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewProjectDetailBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewProjectDetailController
  participant InteriorDesignProject as «entity»<br/>InteriorDesignProject
  participant ProjectImage as «entity»<br/>ProjectImage
  participant ProjectView as «entity»<br/>ProjectView
  participant Favourite as «entity»<br/>Favourite
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: view an IDP's details, photos and designer information
  UI->>B: GET /api/projects/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer projectId, AuthUser caller)
  alt IDP hidden (deleted or designer inactive)
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 404 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>InteriorDesignProject: findVisibleById()
  InteriorDesignProject->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>InteriorDesignProject: rows
  InteriorDesignProject-->>C: result
  C->>ProjectImage: findByProject()
  ProjectImage->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectImage: rows
  ProjectImage-->>C: result
  C->>ProjectView: record()
  ProjectView->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>ProjectView: rows
  ProjectView-->>C: result
  C->>Favourite: exists()
  Favourite->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Favourite: rows
  Favourite-->>C: result
  C-->>B: ProjectDetail
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end